# Fling: "deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power" - its power as it last existed on the battlefield (CR 608.2h,
# the ruling), +1/+1 counters included (CR 122.1a). Walking Ballista is a 0/0 that enters with X +1/+1 counters; cast for X
